stions 11-15","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><p>Choose the correct letter,&nbsp;<strong>A</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>B</strong>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<strong>C</strong>.</p><p class=\"source-transcript-subhead\"><strong><strong>Changes in Barford over the last 50 years</strong></strong></p></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">11</strong><span>In Shona’s opinion, why do fewer people use buses in Barford these days?</span></span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c11-t3-l-q11\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>The buses are old and uncomfortable.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c11-t3-l-q11\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>Fares have gone up too much.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c11-t3-l-q11\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>There are not so many bus routes.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">12</strong><span>What change in the road network is known to have benefited the town most?</span></span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c11-t3-l-q12\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>the construction of a bypass</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c11-t3-l-q12\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>the development of cycle paths</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c11-t3-l-q12\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\"